Codex is signed in with an API key. recite works only with a ChatGPT sign-in, and never uses API keys.
  Sign out, then sign in with ChatGPT:
      CODEX_HOME=/srv/codex-home '/opt/codex tools/bin/codex' logout
      CODEX_HOME=/srv/codex-home '/opt/codex tools/bin/codex' login
  Warning: this changes how Codex itself signs in.
More help: https://learn.chatgpt.com/docs/auth
